{"name":"Cormorant","hex":"#437064","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"cormorant","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Any of various medium-large black seabirds of the family Phalacrocoracidae which dive into water for fish and other aquatic animals, found throughout the world except for islands in the centre of the Pacific Ocean; specifically, the great cormorant (Phalacrocorax carbo).","A voracious eater; also, a person who, or thing which, is aggressively greedy for wealth, etc."]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Voracious; aggressively greedy."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/cormorant"}],"entries":[{"title":"Cormorant","blocks":[{"text":"Phalacrocoracidae is a family of approximately 40 species of aquatic birds found worldwide and commonly known as cormorants and shags. Several different classifications of the family have been proposed, but in 2021 the International Ornithologists' Union (IOU) adopted a consensus taxonomy of seven genera. The common names \"cormorant\" and \"shag\" have been assigned to different species in the family somewhat haphazardly."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/75/Microcarbo_melanoleucos_Austins_Ferry_3.jpg/330px-Microcarbo_melanoleucos_Austins_Ferry_3.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cormorant"},{"title":"Cormorant (band)","blocks":[{"text":"Cormorant is an American progressive metal band from San Francisco, California, formed in 2007. The group consists of bassist and vocalist Marcus Luscombe, guitarists Nick Cohon and Matt Solis, and drummer Brennan Kunkel."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cormorant_(band)"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/39/Cormorant_yawning.jpg/500px-Cormorant_yawning.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/39/Cormorant_yawning.jpg/1280px-Cormorant_yawning.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/39/Cormorant_yawning.jpg/500px-Cormorant_yawning.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Great cormorant with hooked bill","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ACormorant_yawning.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cf/Cormorant_in_Maynaguri.jpg/500px-Cormorant_in_Maynaguri.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cf/Cormorant_in_Maynaguri.jpg/1280px-Cormorant_in_Maynaguri.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cf/Cormorant_in_Maynaguri.jpg/500px-Cormorant_in_Maynaguri.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Little cormorant with wings spread","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ACormorant_in_Maynaguri.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c7/Imperial_Shags.jpg/500px-Imperial_Shags.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c7/Imperial_Shags.jpg/500px-Imperial_Shags.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Imperial shags in Beagle Channel","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AImperial_Shags.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/af/CormoransJoinville.jpg/500px-CormoransJoinville.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/af/CormoransJoinville.jpg/1280px-CormoransJoinville.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wi